he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  musculoskeletal injury in the last three months;\n-  cardiovascular diseases;\n-  use of anabolic, anti-inflammatory and analgesic drugs 72 hours before the evaluations;\n-  use of alcohol and illicit drugs during the collection period;\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- musculoskeletal injury in the last three months;",\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "last"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "months"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "three"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "musculoskeletal injury"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "musculoskeletal injury"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "last three months"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- cardiovascular diseases;",\n              "Condition": [\n                "cardiovascular diseases"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "cardiovascular diseases"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- use of anabolic,",\n              "Drug": [\n                "anabolic"\n              ],\n              "Drug-Name": [\n                "anabolic"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "use"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "use"\n              