he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Male or female patients with invasive bladder cancer scheduled for radical cystectomy at UNC within the next 30 days\n-  English-speaking\n-  Ability to access the Internet (either themselves or with assistance from their caregiver)\n-  Ability to read\n-  Ability to provide informed consent.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Male",\n                      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                        "Male"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or female patients with invasive bladder cancer scheduled for radical cystectomy at UNC within the next 30 days",\n                      "Eq-Operator": [\n                        "within"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                        "days"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "30"\n                      ],\n                      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                        "female"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "invasive bladder cancer"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "invasive bladder cancer"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "radical cystectomy"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\