he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Adults over 50 years old with degenerative scoliosis (n=20) with pain (>2/10). Other inclusion criteria are: (1) curves 15°-45°.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Adults over 50 years old",\n      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n        "Adults"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "over 50 years"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "50"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "years"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "over"\n      ],\n      "Age": [\n        "old"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "with degenerative scoliosis (n=20) with pain (>2/10). Other inclusion criteria are: (1) curves 15°-45°.",\n      "Condition": [\n        "degenerative scoliosis"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "degenerative scoliosis"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "15°-45°",\n        ">2/10"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "15",\n        "45",\n        "2"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Unit": [\n        "°",\n        "10"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "-",\n        ">"\n      ],\n      "Observation": [\n        "pain",\n        "curves"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "pain",\n        "curves"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Unit": [\n        "n"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
Response: {
  "AND": {
    "left": {
      "raw_text": "- Adults over 50 years old",
      "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [
        "Adults"
      ],
      "Eq-Comparison": [
