he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Use of rituximab, belimumab, eculizumab or any monoclonal antibody for immunomodulation within 6 months prior to first dosing.\n2. Immunoglobulins given by SC, IV (IVIG), or intramuscular route, or plasmapheresis/plasma exchange (PE) within 4 weeks before Screening.\n3. Thymectomy performed < 12 months prior to screening.\n4. Total IgG level <6 g/L (at screening).\n5. Absolute neutrophil count <1500 cells/mm3(at screening).\nOther, more specific exclusion criteria are defined in the protocol\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "1. Use of rituximab,",\n                      "Eq-Value": [\n                        "1"\n                      ],\n                      "Drug": [\n                        "rituximab"\n                      ],\n                      "Drug-Name": [\n                        "rituximab"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "Use"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "Use"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "belimumab,",\n                          "Drug": [\n                            "belimumab"\n                          ],\n                          "Drug-Name": [\n                            "belimumab"\n                          ]\n   