he logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Undergoing non-elective procedure\n-  Cognitive impairment precluding self-reporting of pain\n-  Hematologic/oncologic condition\n-  Liver of kidney conditions precluding usual analgesic prescription patters (opioid plus a non-opioid)\n-  Use of opioids for prolonged pain pre-operatively (<2 weeks)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Undergoing"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "NOT": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "non-elective procedure",\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "procedure"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "procedure"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "elective"\n                      ],\n                      "Negation": [\n                        "non"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Cognitive impairment precluding self-reporting of pain",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Cognitive impairment"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "Cognitive impairment"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "pain"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "pain"\n                  ],\n                  "Stability": [\n                    "precluding"\n                  ],\n                  "Assertion": [\n                    "precluding"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Hematologic/",\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "Hematologic"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "oncologic condition",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "condition"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "oncologic"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Liver of kidney conditions precluding usual analgesic prescription patters (opioid plus a non-opioid)",\n              "Condition": [\n                "conditions"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "conditions"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "kidney",\n                "Liver"\n              ],\n              "Drug": [\n                "opioid",\n                "non-opioid",\n                "analgesic"\n              ],\n              "Drug-Name": [\n                "opioid",\n                "non-opioid",\n                "analgesic"\n              ],\n              "Stability": [\n                "precluding"\n              ],\n              "Assertion": [\n                "precluding"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Use of opioids for prolonged pain pre-operatively (<2 weeks)",\n              "Observation": [\n                "pain"\n         